<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ziyadat Allah I</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">died 838</span> · <a href="/centuries/9th-century">9th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Ziyadat <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/allah">Allah</a> I was the Aghlabid emir of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ifriqiya">Ifriqiya</a> from 817 to 838. After surviving a long revolt of the Arab army, he sent a fleet under the jurist Asad ibn al-Furat to invade Byzantine <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sicily">Sicily</a> in 827, beginning a conquest that took about seventy-five years. He also rebuilt the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/great-mosque-of-kairouan">Great Mosque of Kairouan</a> in 836.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ziyadat-allah-i.jpg" alt="Ziyadat Allah I" width="320" height="167" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: DrFO.Jr.Tn · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aghlabid_dirham_-_Ziyadat_Allah_I_-_209_AH.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
